ahre nach der Einnahme Karthagos verkauft ein Paar Nutzungsrechte. Die Holztafel trägt eine Datierung nach dem Regierungsjahr eines vandalischen Königs.","en":"Around fifty years after the capture of Carthage, a couple sells cultivation rights. The wooden record dates the transaction by a Vandal king’s regnal year."},"state":{"time":{"kind":"instant","at":{"earliest":{"year":494,"month":1,"day":1},"latest":{"year":494,"month":12,"day":31},"qualifier":"exact","precision":"year"}},"camera":{"longitude":8.7,"latitude":35.9,"metersPerPixel":2200,"bearing":0,"pitch":0},"layers":["attested-at","controls","extent-of","events","migrations"]}},{"id":"italy-500","textAnchor":"ravenna","labels":{"de":"500 · Ravenna und Rom","en":"500 · Ravenna and Rome"},"summary":{"de":"Der Senat und Papst Symmachus empfingen den König in Rom. Seine Residenz blieb in Ravenna.","en":"The Senate and Pope Symmachus received the king in Rome. His residence remained at Ravenna."},"state":{"camera":{"longitude":12.25,"latitude":43.2,"metersPerPixel":1700,"bearing":0,"pitch":0},"time":{"kind":"instant","at":{"earliest":{"year":500,"month":1,"day":1},"latest":{"year":500,"month":12,"day":31},"precision":"year","qualifier":"exact"}},"layers":["attested-at","controls","extent-of","events","migrations"]}},{"id":"vouille-507","textAnchor":"toledo","labels":{"de":"507 · Im Raum von Poitiers","en":"507 · Near Poitiers"},"summary":{"de":"Gregor nennt den zehnten Meilenstein von Poitiers. Die Lage des Schlachtfelds ist umstritten.","en":"Gregory mentions the tenth milestone from Poitiers. The precise battlefield is disputed."},"state":{"camera":{"longitude":0.25,"latitude":46.51,"metersPerPixel":1400,"bearing":0,"pitch":0},"time":{"kind":"instant","at":{"earliest":{"year":507,"month":1,"day":1},"latest":{"year":507,"month":12,"day":31},"precision":"year","qualifier":"exact"}},"layers":["attested-at","controls","extent-of","events","migrations"]}},{"id":"toledo-589","textAnchor":"toledo","labels":{"de":"589 · Ein Konzil in Toledo","en":"589 · A council in Toledo"},"summary":{"de":"Während in Recópolis Glas verarbeitet wurde, traten die Bischöfe flussabwärts in Toledo zusammen.","en":"While glass was being worked at Reccopolis, the bishops gathered downstream at Toledo."},"state":{"camera":{"longitude":-4.03,"latitude":39.87,"metersPerPixel":1400,"bearing":0,"pitch":0},"time":{"kind":"instant","at":{"earliest":{"year":589,"month":1,"day":1},"latest":{"year":589,"month":12,"day":31},"precision":"year","qualifier":"exact"}},"layers":["attested-at","controls","extent-of","events","migrations"]}}],"discovery":{"summary":{"de":"Wo lassen sich Goten und ihre Nachbarn zu einem bestimmten Zeitpunkt tatsächlich fassen? Zehn Kartenstationen führen von den Gräbern an der Weichsel über den Schwarzmeerraum und die Donau bis zu den Höfen von Ravenna und Toledo. Für 410 sind Rom und Hispania zugleich zu sehen.","en":"Where can we place Goths and their neighbours at a particular moment? Ten map stops lead from cemeteries on the Vistula through the Black Sea region and across the Danube to the courts of Ravenna and Toledo. In 410 Rome and Hispania can be seen side by side."},"periods":[{"id":"late-antiquity","labels":{"de":"Spätantike","en":"Late Antiquity"},"description":{"de":"Die Kapitel zur Völkerwanderung führen durch die spätrömische Welt. Die Funde an der unteren Weichsel reichen in die römische Kaiserzeit zurück und gehören zur Vorgeschichte der Reihe.","en":"These chapters follow the Migration Period in the late Roman world. Evidence on the lower Vistula goes back to the Roman Imperial period and introduces the earlier history of the series."}}],"regions":[{"id":"europe","labels":{"de":"Europa","en":"Europe"}},{"id":"north-africa","labels":{"de":"Nordafrika","en":"North Africa"}}],"topics":[{"id":"migration-period","labels":{"de":"Völkerwanderung","en":"Migration Period"}},{"id":"archaeology","labels":{"de":"Archäologie","en":"Archaeology"}},{"id":"social-life","labels":{"de":"Z